   ],
   "content": [
    {
     "body": "The LS_UP level shifter must translate signals from core supply (VDDL) to I/O supply (VDDH) across the full supply range 1.4\u202fV\u20135.5\u202fV, operate from \u201355\u202f\u00b0C to\u202f+125\u202f\u00b0C, and meet static\u2011current and propagation\u2011delay targets.",
     "heading": "Requirement",
     "status": "requirement"
    },
    {
     "body": "Target static\u2011current per input \u2264\u202f0.05\u202fnA at VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.4\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV; \u2264\u202f0.1\u202fnA at VDDL\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f5.5\u202fV. Target rise\u2011time \u2264\u202f0.35\u202fns across all corners.",
     "heading": "Assumption",
     "status": "assumption"
    },
    {
     "body": "Functional simulation of LS_UP passed for all supply combinations and temperatures. Measured static currents (nA) and input rise\u2011time (ns) are summarized:\n\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.4\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.017\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.021\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.001\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.30\u202fns.\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.4\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f5.5\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.036\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.042\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.001\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.35\u202fns.\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.8\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.017\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.021\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.002\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.21\u202fns.\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.8\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f5.5\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.036\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.042\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.002\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.23\u202fns.\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.017\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.021\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.003\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.053\u202fns.\n- VDDL\u202f=\u202f3.3\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f5.5\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f0.036\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f0.042\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1\u202f=\u202f0.003\u202fnA, tpd_rise\u202f=\u202f0.055\u202fns.\n\nAll measurements satisfy the assumed targets. No functional failures were observed at any temperature or process corner.",
     "heading": "Simulated Functional Results",
     "status": "simulated_functional"
    },
    {
     "body": "PVT sweep (tt/ff/ss corners, \u201355\u202f\u00b0C, 25\u202f\u00b0C, 125\u202f\u00b0C) confirmed that LS_UP passes functional checks at every corner. Static currents increase with temperature as expected (e.g., at 125\u202f\u00b0C, VDDL\u202f=\u202f1.4\u202fV, VDDH\u202f=\u202f5.5\u202fV, I_VDDH_in0\u202f=\u202f2.347\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1\u202f=\u202f3.186\u202fnA) but remain well below the assumed limits. Propagation delays remain \u2264\u202f0.35\u202fns across the full PVT space.",
     "heading": "PVT Corner Verification",
     "status": "derived"
    },
    {
     "body": "The LS_UP level shifter meets the functional and PVT requirements for the Apogee RHBD I/O library. The design is ready for layout sign\u2011off.",
     "heading": "Conclusion",
     "status": "derived"
    }
